          "settings": {
            "column": "col_1",
            "visibility": "always-display",
            "text": "<p></p><p><strong>Customize Your Sofa!</strong><br/>For the Pebble Sofa, customization can be ordered directly by selecting the \"<a href=\"/collections/customization\" title=\"Customization\">Customization</a>\" option on our website. For other sofas, feel free to contact us via the form below or reach out to us on Facebook to inquire about the customization process.</p><p><strong>Order Your Swatches Today</strong><br/>Looking for the perfect fabric and color for your sofa? Visit our <a href=\"/products/swatches\" title=\"Swatches\">Swatches Product Page</a> to order fabric samples and customize with confidence!</p><p><strong>Need Help Finding Your Fabric?</strong><br/>Don't see the fabric you’re looking for? Reach out to us through the <strong>Contact Us</strong> form, and we’ll assist you in finding the perfect match!</p><p>We will get back to you via email within 2 days. For a quicker response, feel free to contact us on Facebook. Our team is available 7 days a week, from 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM Melbourne time (AEDT).</p><p>We are constantly working to include more fabric options in our products. If you have specific fabric preferences not currently listed, let us know—we’re always here to help!</p>",
